{
  "sourcePatchId": "283de422-73e2-4e84-b967-1c3a0171224e",
  "name": "Almost DX7",
  "description": "Dry six-operator FM/PM synthesizer with eight algorithms. Preset is an integer performance controller (1\u201312). 1: Tine Piano; 2: Soft Electric Piano; 3: FM Bass; 4: Slap Bass; 5: Glass Bell; 6: Wooden Mallet; 7: Synth Brass; 8: Digital Organ; 9: Bright Pluck; 10: Evolving Pad; 11: Metallic Lead; 12: Shimmer Keys. Brightness, Attack, Release, Vibrato and Output affect new notes. Per-operator ADSRs and velocity response are inside FM6. Edit FM6 to design a custom voice; select preset 0 there and disconnect the preset controller (or extend its minimum to 0). Centered Stereo Output; add effects in mixer routing. 16 simultaneous voices. Inspired by 1980s FM, without DX7 patch/SysEx compatibility.",
